{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02556","headline":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得归 · 许敬宗","name":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倦游嗟落拓，短翮慕追飞。\n周醪忽同醉，牙弦乃共挥。\n油云澹寒色，落景霭霜霏。\n累日方投分，兹夕谅无归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}